From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: babarot <b4b4r07@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:09:35 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Show the raw view full screen, highlighted in the editor's
 colors

The raw toggle showed the Markdown source inside the page layout, always
in github-dark. It now fills the content area like the editor, wraps long
lines, uses the font size setting, and highlights with the Shiki theme
that matches the editor color scheme and the page theme. Non-Markdown
files are highlighted with the same theme.
---
 .../src/components/MarkdownViewer.tsx         | 107 ++++++++++++++++--
 internal/frontend/src/lib/editorThemes.ts     |  15 +++
 2 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/internal/frontend/src/components/MarkdownViewer.tsx b/internal/frontend/src/components/MarkdownViewer.tsx
index dc9ce7a..1838861 100644
--- a/internal/frontend/src/components/MarkdownViewer.tsx
+++ b/internal/frontend/src/components/MarkdownViewer.tsx
